{"title":"Shade","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 23 Ghost that attacks with freeze (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">shock</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">stab</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 1 times (16.7% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      <p class=\"s\">Special: drainFrac: .2</p>\n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/soul-shard\">Soul Shard</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/shade\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/shade?lv=23\">Lv 23 <span>34</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/shade?lv=24\">Lv 24 <span>6</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/shade?lv=23\" title=\"Pick level 23\"><td><b>23</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>79</td><td>17.2</td><td>1,150</td><td class=\"muted\">237 · 24.1 · 3,450</td><td>34</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/shade?lv=24\" title=\"Pick level 24\"><td><b>24</b></td><td>84</td><td>17.7</td><td>1,200</td><td class=\"muted\">252 · 24.8 · 3,600</td><td>6</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 5 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 9 recorded drops, 287 total, 12–90 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×12–90</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"spirit-essence\" title=\"Spirit Essence - in 3 of 5 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 2 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/8875c6f441ed9a66c7ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Spirit Essence</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.7<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"snakeskin-torso\" title=\"Snakeskin Torso - in 1 of 5 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/369f38cef692acd31f9d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Snakeskin Torso</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/5<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"health-potion-medium\" title=\"Health Potion Medium - in 1 of 5 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/6003f0952eddf298b4c8.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Health Potion Medium</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/5<br>×1</span></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>⭐ Elite loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"spirit-essence\" title=\"Spirit Essence - in 3 of 5 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 2 total, 2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/8875c6f441ed9a66c7ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Spirit Essence</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.7<br>×2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"bearhide-torso\" title=\"Bearhide Torso (weasel x1) - in 1 of 5 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/ede6dbbeeddfa6e7c5c3.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bearhide Torso</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/5<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1 · Enchanted: 1 of 1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>Haunted Cavern</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 40</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-111\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><p class=\"muted\">No sightings yet.</p>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Ghost: <a href=\"#/monster/wraith\">Wraith</a> <span class=\"muted\">(29)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/banshee\">Banshee</a> <span class=\"muted\">(35)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/4eff2e68ec2f7fa73e76.webp\" alt=\"Shade\"></div><h3>Shade</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>23 <span class=\"muted\">(seen 0–24)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Ghost</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>freeze · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>79</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>17.2</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>1150</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>3.6 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>No</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>6 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}